<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta name="csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token() }}">
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Request gemstone testing and track your laboratory order with GemLab Desk.">
  <title>GemLab Desk | Gemstone Testing & Reports</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/portal.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar"><a class="logo" href="/"><span class="logo-mark">G</span><span>GEMLAB <i>DESK</i></span></a><nav><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#process">How it works</a><a href="#track">Track order</a><a class="staff-link" href="/login">Staff login ↗</a></nav></header>
<main>
  <section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">GEMSTONE LABORATORY SERVICES</p><h1>Confidence in every<br><em>precious stone.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">Request gemstone testing, follow your sample through the laboratory, and access your issued report in one place.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn gold" href="#request">Request a test <span>→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#track">Already submitted? Track order</a></div><div class="trust-line"><span>●</span> Simple submission · Clear progress · Digital reports</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><div class="gem-scene"><div class="gem-shadow"></div><svg class="gem" viewBox="0 0 360 330" role="img" aria-label="Decorative faceted gemstone"><defs><linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#fff3cf"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#d8b66d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#76552c"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="g2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#f7e6b4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9e773e"/></linearGradient></defs><polygon points="180,18 290,80 330,165 180,310 30,165 70,80" fill="url(#g1)" stroke="#f5e4b9" stroke-width="2"/><polygon points="70,80 180,18 140,112 30,165" fill="#fff0c9" opacity=".78"/><polygon points="180,18 290,80 220,112 140,112" fill="#e9cf91"/><polygon points="290,80 330,165 220,112" fill="#a98248"/><polygon points="30,165 140,112 180,310" fill="#c49b58"/><polygon points="140,112 220,112 180,310" fill="url(#g2)"/><polygon points="220,112 330,165 180,310" fill="#896333"/><path d="M70 80L140 112 180 18 220 112 290 80M30 165L140 112 180 310 220 112 330 165" fill="none" stroke="#fff4d6" stroke-opacity=".65" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="gem-caption">PRECISION · TRUST · CLARITY</div></div><div class="floating-note"><span class="note-icon">✧</span><span><b>Your report, online</b><small>Secure order tracking</small></span></div></div></section>
  <section class="services section" id="services"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE DO</p><h2>Testing made straightforward.</h2><p>Choose the service you need when submitting your gemstone details. The laboratory will confirm the scope and applicable charges.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon">◇</span><h3>Gemstone identification</h3><p>Laboratory examination to help identify the submitted gemstone material.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon">✧</span><h3>Treatment assessment</h3><p>Record observations and findings related to detectable treatments.</p></article><article class="service-card"><span class="service-icon">⌕</span><h3>Report verification</h3><p>Check an issued report using its unique report number or QR code.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="process section" id="process"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR PROCESS</p><h2>From submission to report.</h2></div><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Submit a request</h3><p>Share your contact and gemstone details.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Laboratory intake</h3><p>Staff review the request and register the sample.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Testing & review</h3><p>Technicians record observations and authorised staff review findings.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Get your report</h3><p>Track progress and access the report once it is issued.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="portal-panels section"><div class="panel request-panel" id="request"><div class="panel-heading"><p class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</p><h2>Request gemstone testing</h2><p>Send your details. Our team can follow up to confirm the service and next steps.</p></div><form id="request-form" class="form-grid"><label class="wide">Full name *<input name="name" required placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Phone number *<input name="phone" required inputmode="tel" placeholder="Registered contact number"></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label>Business / company<input name="company" placeholder="Optional"></label><label>Service required *<select name="service" required><option value="">Select a service</option><option>Gemstone identification</option><option>Treatment assessment</option><option>Identification + treatment assessment</option><option>Other / need guidance</option></select></label><label class="wide">Gemstone description *<textarea name="description" required rows="3" placeholder="E.g. one oval blue stone, loose / mounted..."></textarea></label><div class="two-col"><label>Gemstone type (if known)<input name="gemstone_type" placeholder="e.g. Sapphire"></label><label>Colour<input name="colour" placeholder="e.g. Blue"></label></div><div class="two-col"><label>Approx. weight (carats)<input name="weight" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="Optional"></label><label>Number of pieces<input name="pieces" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label></div><label class="wide">Additional notes<textarea name="notes" rows="2" placeholder="Anything the lab should know?"></textarea></label><button class="btn gold wide" type="submit">Submit testing request <span>→</span></button><p class="form-foot wide">Submitting a request does not confirm a diagnosis, price, or appointment. The laboratory will review your details.</p></form><div id="request-result" class="result-box" hidden></div></div>
  <div class="panel track-panel" id="track"><div class="panel-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ORDER STATUS</p><h2>Track your submission</h2><p>Enter the order number you received and the phone number used when submitting the request.</p></div><form id="track-form" class="track-form"><label>Order number<input name="order_no" required placeholder="e.g. GL-00001"></label><label>Registered phone number<input name="phone" required inputmode="tel" placeholder="Your phone number"></label><button class="btn dark" type="submit">Track order <span>→</span></button></form><div id="track-result" class="track-result" hidden></div><div class="help-note"><span>?</span><p><b>Can't find your order number?</b><br>Contact the laboratory and share the phone number used for your request.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="verify-strip"><div><p class="eyebrow">HAVE A REPORT NUMBER?</p><h2>Verify an issued report.</h2><p>Confirm whether a report number exists in the GemLab Desk records.</p></div><a class="btn outline" href="/verify">Verify certificate ↗</a></section>
</main>
<footer><a class="logo" href="/"><span class="logo-mark">G</span><span>GEMLAB <i>DESK</i></span></a><span>Independent laboratory workflow software · Demo product</span><a href="/login">Staff access</a></footer>
<script src="/assets/portal.js"></script>
</body></html>
